1. Topological Frequencies: Descriptors related to atom connectivity at specific distances, e.g., F03[C-N], F04[C-N], F02[C-N], F03[C-O], and F01[N-N].

2. Atomic Compositions: Describing elemental counts and percentages, e.g., nN, nX, nHM, C%, nCb-, nCp, nCrt, and nArNO2.

3. Hydrogen-Bonding Properties: Indicators of hydrogen donors/acceptors, e.g., nHDon_nO_sqrt_multiply, nN-N, SdO, nArCOOR.

4. Spectral and Structural Indices: Descriptors derived from matrices and topological indices, e.g., SpMax_L, SpMax_B(m), SpPosA_B(p), SM6_B(m), J_Dz(e), LOC, TI2_L, Me.

