Focus on these descriptor groups for feature interactions and transformations to improve the predictability of the downstream biodegradability classification task.

Subproblem 2: Decide on appropriate transformations, interactions, or combinations (e.g., ratios, logs, products, or domain-specific formulas) to enhance the relationship between molecular structure and biodegradability within the operator set.
